  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The number of solutions will be the number of points of intersection of&nbsp;the graphs <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Plotting the two curves on the same axis, we get,&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0030_375264bf3719.png\" style=\"width: 456px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>the number of intersection as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
